CherrygroveCity_Text_GuideRequest::
    .string "Welcome to CHERRYGROVE!\n"
    .string "You are helping ELM, are you?\p"
    .string "MR. POKEMON has a research\n"
    .string "report for his lab.\p"
    .string "His house is on ROUTE 30,\n"
    .string "north of town.\p"
    .string "The red roof is our CENTER.\n"
    .string "Stock up at the blue MART.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_GuideBeforeLab::
    .string "Welcome! The airstrip is south,\n"
    .string "and ROUTE 30 is north.\p"
    .string "If you came to help ELM,\n"
    .string "follow ROUTE 29 east.\p"
    .string "His lab is in NEW BARK TOWN.\n"
    .string "Visit his research team first.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_GuideAgain::
    .string "Follow ROUTE 30 north to\n"
    .string "MR. POKEMON on the hill.\p"
    .string "Take his report back to ELM\n"
    .string "in NEW BARK TOWN.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_GuideReportDone::
    .string "You brought the report to ELM!\n"
    .string "Thanks for helping our region.\p"
    .string "Keep comparing your POKEDEX\n"
    .string "as you explore JOHTO.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_Girl::
    .string "From the airstrip, ROUTE 29\n"
    .string "leads east to NEW BARK TOWN.\p"
    .string "CHERRYGROVE is the town just\n"
    .string "north of the airstrip.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_Fisher::
    .string "The sea links our regions.\n"
    .string "Trainers arrive from KANTO.\p"
    .string "Even familiar POKEMON can\n"
    .string "live differently in JOHTO.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_CenterSign::
    .string "POKEMON CENTER\n"
    .string "Rest and recover here.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_MartSign::
    .string "POKEMON MART\n"
    .string "Travel supplies sold here.$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_GuideSign::
    .string "THE GUIDE GENT LIVES HERE.$"


CherrygroveCity_Hns_Text_GuideOffer::
    .string "Welcome to CHERRYGROVE!\p"
    .string "Even experienced TRAINERS can\n"
    .string "use a guide in a new town.\p"
    .string "Would you like a few local tips?$"

CherrygroveCity_Hns_Text_Center::
	.string "Our town has a POKéMON CENTER.\p"
	.string "They heal your POKéMON in no\n"
	.string "time at all.\p"
	.string "You'll be relying on them a lot,\n"
	.string "so you better learn about them.$"

CherrygroveCity_Hns_Text_Mart::
	.string "We also have a POKéMON MART.\p"
	.string "They sell BALLS for catching wild\n"
	.string "POKéMON and other useful items.$"

CherrygroveCity_Hns_Text_Route30::
	.string "ROUTE 30 is north of town.\p"
	.string "Trainers will be battling\n"
	.string "their prized POKéMON there.$"


CherrygroveCity_Text_FirstSilverIntro::
    .string "You came from ELM's lab?\p"
    .string "This TOTODILE is strong.\n"
    .string "I will show you its power!$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_FirstSilverDefeat::
    .string "...You got in my way!$"

CherrygroveCity_Text_FirstSilverAfter::
    .string "My name is SILVER.\n"
    .string "I will be the strongest TRAINER.\p"
    .string "Remember that.$"

